<title>USA: Granite gets $100 mln financing.</title>
<headline>Granite gets $100 mln financing.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Golf Group Inc said it arranged for $100 million in forward financing to be used to advance its golf course acquisition and operations management program.</p>
<p>The financing is provided by Lone Star Opportunity Fund LP, a Dallas-based investment fund formed by senior managers of Brazos Fund LP, a $250 million real estate investment partnership also headquartered in Dallas.  Lone Star Opportunity Fund closed on $400 million in equity commitments in March of this year.</p>
</text>
